      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-medellin-50-centavos/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"The Bank of Medellin — 50 Centavos\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/free-banking/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Free Banking catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Free Banking &middot; Medellín, Antioquia &middot; 1880s</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">The Bank of Medellin</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Fifty Cents &middot; Series A, N.&deg; A307025</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"colombia-banco-de-medellin-50-centavos\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-medellin-50-centavos.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-medellin-50-centavos.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Banknote of Fifty Cents de The Bank of Medellin, obverse arriba con retrato femenino y viñeta de colmena, reverse abajo con guilloché anaranjado y sello circular rosado\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"542\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Colombia (Sovereign State / Department of Antioquia)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Banco de Medellín, Antioquia banking company</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Fifty Cents, in current coins</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Type of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Bearer and demand banknote, issued by a private bank established during the era of free banking in Antioquia</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Series / Number</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Series A, No.&deg; A307025 (numbering duplicated in both upper corners)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Place and Year</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Medellín, 1880s (date not filled out in this specimen: &ldquo;Medellín&hellip; of&hellip; of 18&hellip;&rdquo;)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rarity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Uncommon: issuance by one of the Antioquian regional banks of the era of free banking, today scarcely represented in collections</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick S591</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"colombia-banco-de-medellin-50-centavos\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-medellin-50-centavos.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-medellin-50-centavos.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of Fifty Cents de The Bank of Medellin, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">One of the banks of banking-era Medellín:</strong>The Banco de Medellín was part of the first generation of private banks that emerged in Antioquia after the founding, in 1872, of the Banco de Antioquia &mdash;, the first in the region, of a semi-official nature. By 1884 the city already had about a dozen of its own banking entities, among them the Banco de Antioquia, the Banco Popular de Medellín, the Banco del Progreso, the Banco de Oriente and the Banco de Medellín itself, along with commercial-banking houses such as Vicente B. Villa é Hijos and Botero Arango é Hijos.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Among the most far-reaching entities:</strong>unlike the family commercial houses that also issued their own banknotes, the Bank of Medellín was constituted as a banking company properly speaking. Studies on banking penetration in Antioquia place Banco de Antioquia and Banco de Medellín among the entities with the largest number of customers in the region, in contrast to more family-oriented houses with limited reach such as Vicente B. Villa é Hijos.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Medellín in the era of gold and commerce:</strong>The Antioquia banking boom of the 1870s and 1880s was closely linked to gold mining and the region's import-export trade, which generated the capital and commercial confidence necessary to sustain the private issuance of paper money as a complement to the scarce metallic currency in circulation.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Left vignette:</strong>bust portrait of a woman within an ornamental oval, framed by a decorative border &mdash;a common iconographic device on 19th-century Colombian banknotes.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Upper central vignette:</strong>a beehive flanked by olive branches, a classic symbol of industriousness and thrift frequently seen in 19th-century banknote iconography.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Right vignette:</strong>Circular medallion with a bunch of grapes, in dark ink on an engraved background.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Text of the obligation:</strong>&ldquo;Shall pay to bearer and sight the amount of Fifty Cents in ordinary coins,&rdquo; with the handwritten signatures of the Cashier, Manager, and Accountant, and the typographic watermark &ldquo;50&rdquo; superimposed on the design.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Numbering:</strong>&ldquo;N.&deg; A307025&rdquo; repeated in both top corners, with the series printed next to the header &ldquo;EL BANCO DE MEDELLIN&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>complete geometric guilloche in orange ink, with the value &ldquo;50&rdquo; and the legend &ldquo;FIFTY CENTS&rdquo; repeated on the medallions, and a circular seal in pink ink superimposed on the design, partially illegible.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Additional Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">This specimen, without a date completed, is representative of the profusion of regional banks that characterized Antioquia during the era of free banking &mdash;a system that the Regeneration of 1886 would end up centralizing, decades before the Bank of the Republic assumed in 1923 the absolute monopoly of monetary issuance in Colombia.</p>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. &ldquo;Currency and Banking in Antioquia &mdash; Colombia in the Late Nineteenth Century&rdquo;,<em>Revista de Historia Económica y Social</em>. Available at scielo.org.co.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">2. Botero Herrera, María Mercedes. &ldquo;Banking Institutions in Antioquia, 1872&ndash;1886.&rdquo;<em>Economics Readings</em>, n.&deg; 17, Medellín, May&ndash;agosto de 1985, pp. 43&ndash;147.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <aside aria-labelledby=\"related-reading-heading\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:900px; margin:48px auto 0; padding-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n      <h2 id=\"related-reading-heading\" style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 16px; font-style:normal;\">Keep exploring</h2>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr)); gap:14px;\">\n        <a href=\"/blog/origenes-banca-comercial-colombia-banca-libre/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Origins of commercial banking in Colombia</a>\n        <a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/vicente-villa-e-hijos-5-pesos/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Vicente B. Villa and Sons — 5 pesos</a>\n        <a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-antioquia-warrant-10-centavos-1900/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Banco de Antioquia — 10-cent draft</a>\n        <a href=\"/glosario/#banca-libre\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Glossary: free banking</a>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
